# IUPAC Digitized pKa Dataset -- consumed by the pipeline, never redistributed.
# Licensed CC-BY-NC-4.0 (Zenodo 10.5281/zenodo.15375522), which is not
# compatible with how this database is distributed, so the values stay out of
# the repository in every form. Regenerate locally with
# Scripts/Structures/Fetch_IUPAC_pKas.py; the manifest entry in
# Biochemistry/Structures/sources.yaml records the DOI and the procedure.
Biochemistry/Structures/ModelSEED/pkas/iupac_*.tsv
# Same rule, second form: the combined literature ladder table interleaves
# Alberty (redistributable) with IUPAC (not), so only the Alberty-only
# ..._open.tsv is committed. Regenerate both with
# Scripts/Thermodynamics/ProtonationEvidence/build_ladder_table.py.
Biochemistry/Thermodynamics/ProtonationEvidence/literature_ladders.tsv
